!CHECK 225502.62 | 00000000003 | line 8 field 8, 3 | 32
!CHECK 225503.22 | 00000000740 | line 9 field 9, 480 | 32
!CHECK 225503.62 | 00000000002 | line 10 field 10, 2 (a "*" after the location) | 32
!CHECK 225504.22 | 00000000757 | line 11 field 11, 495 | 32
!CHECK 225504.62 | 00000000001 | line 12 field 12, 1 | 32
!CHECK 225505.22 | 00000000776 | line 15 DD(BU,32),510 (prints CC(BU,32)) | 32
